{
 "about": "Capture Calculator test cases (Chess Arcade + Repertoire Lab, 2026-11-19). Each case: a start position (fen), the moves played from it (SAN), and at = how many of them the board is at (stepping back; all when absent). expect is what both apps must compute for the board at that point. Fake positions only (well-known openings and made-up endgames).",
 "values": {
  "p": 1,
  "n": 3,
  "b": 3,
  "r": 5,
  "q": 9
 },
 "rules": [
  "Only material won or lost from the start position counts. Each move earns its mover points: the captured piece's value, plus (promotion) the new piece's value minus 1 (queen +8, rook +4, bishop or knight +2). A capturing promotion counts both. En passant takes a pawn (1).",
  "white / black: the points each side earned up to the board. balance = white - black (above 0: White ahead).",
  "events: one per move up to the board, in order. label = move number + SAN as the app writes it (\"15. Bxh7+\", \"15...Kxh7\"). took / promo: piece letters or null. text: \"takes a <piece>\", \"promotes to a <piece>\", or both joined by \", \"; \"\" for a quiet move. pointsText: \"+N\" or \"\".",
  "later: the labels of the moves after the board (shown, not counted).",
  "status (checked in this order): \"mate\" when the side to move is checkmated; \"open\" when there was a capture or promotion and the side to move can legally capture on the square of the LAST one (legal moves: a pinned piece cannot); \"done\" after at least one capture or promotion; else \"none\". square: that square for \"open\".",
  "lines (exact words; \"(you)\" goes after the color the app knows is the player's, in balance and the took/promoted lines only, never in the verdict): start \"Start: this position, White to move\" (the app writes \"Start: after 14...Nd7, White to move\" when it knows the move before), balance \"White +2\" / \"Black +3\" / \"Even\"; whiteTook / blackTook \"White took: bishop, pawn (4)\" or \"... took: nothing\" (null before any capture or promotion), pieces in the order taken; whitePromo / blackPromo \"White promoted: queen (+8)\" (null when that side did not promote); status \"No captures yet.\" / \"Not finished: Black can take back on e5.\" / \"Trades finished.\" / \"Checkmate. The count doesn\u2019t matter now.\"; verdict (only with \"Trades finished.\"): \"White comes out ahead by 2.\" / \"Black comes out ahead by 3.\" / \"It\u2019s an even trade.\"",
  "Hide the count hides pointsText, balance, the bar, the took/promoted lines and the verdict; the moves (label + text) and the status line stay."
 ],
